        "title": "Environmental Impact and Microplastics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n   PHOTODEGRADATION\n   ─────────────────\n   UV breaks C-C and C=O bonds\n   Chains shorten → embrittlement → fragmentation\n   NOT mineralization — still carbon polymer, just smaller\n   PE in UV: 2–5 years to fragment (but fragments persist centuries)"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ENVIRONMENTAL.md#007",
      "path": [
        "07-ENVIRONMENTAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:plastics-polymers:07-environmental, git-history:plastics-polymers:07-environmental]",
        "canonical_path": "plastics-polymers/07-ENVIRONMENTAL.md",
