        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Environmental Impact and Microplastics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "THERMAL OXIDATION\n   ─────────────────\n   O2 + heat → hydroperoxide → chain scission\n   Compounds the photodegradation"
    },
    {
      "id": "07-ENVIRONMENTAL.md#009",
      "path": [
        "07-ENVIRONMENTAL.md"
