        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Environmental Impact and Microplastics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BIODEGRADATION (true)\n   ─────────────────────\n   Enzymes break bonds → monomers/oligomers → CO2 + H2O + biomass\n   VERY slow for PE, PP (no enzyme recognition sites)\n   Fast for PLA (industrial compost ≥ 58°C, specific microbiome)\n   PHA: degrades in soil/water (months)\n   Cellulose acetate: intermediate\n```"
    },
