        "title": "Environmental Impact and Microplastics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "| Polymer | Environment | Estimated degradation time |\n|---------|-------------|---------------------------|\n| PE film | Seawater | 200–400+ years (fragmentation, not mineralization) |\n| HDPE pipe | Buried | 500+ years |\n| PET bottle | Ocean | ~450 years |\n| PVC pipe | Buried | 100–200 years |\n| PP fishing net | Ocean | 600 years |\n| Nylon fishing net | Ocean | 40–600 years |\n| PLA (certified compostable) | Industrial compost | 3–6 months |\n| PLA | Cold ocean | 100+ years (barely different from PE) |\n| PHA | Soil/marine | Months to ~5 years |"
    },
